insert into public.passages (source_id, ordinal, content, language)
values (
  '5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001'::uuid,
  10,
  $passage$The cyclic reaction is similar to that of the non-cyclic but differs in that it generates only ATP, and no reduced NADP (NADPH) is created. The cyclic reaction takes place only at photosystem I. Once the electron is displaced from the photosystem, the electron is passed down the electron acceptor molecules and returns to photosystem I, from where it was emitted, hence the name cyclic reaction.$passage$,
  'en'
) on conflict (source_id, ordinal) do nothing;

