 where p.source_id = '5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003'::uuid and p.ordinal = 9
on conflict do nothing;

insert into public.passages (source_id, ordinal, content, language)
values (
  '5eed0000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003'::uuid,
  10,
  $passage$Both the amount of relearning sessions and the number of days in between each session have a major impact on retention (the repetition effect and the spacing effect), yet the two variables do not interact with each other.

For all three difficulty rankings of the foreign words, recall was highest for the 56-day interval as opposed to a 28-day or a 14-day interval. Additionally, 13 sessions spaced 56 days apart yielded comparable retention to 26 sessions with a 14-day interval.$passage$,
  'en'
) on conflict (source_id, ordinal) do nothing;

